elements.description:
POST
POST: Give an active Admin or Owner co-CM rights.
  Who: the CM.
  In: path id; { userId }
  Out: 200 { members: CampaignMember[] }
  Errors: 400 invalid, 401 unauthenticated, 403 forbidden not the CM or other site, 404 not_found, 409 conflict not an active Admin or Owner, or already has rights.

POST
POST: Hand the CM role to a co-CM; the old CM becomes a co-CM.
  Who: the CM, and Owners.
  In: path id; { userId }
  Out: 200 { members: CampaignMember[] }
  Errors: 400 invalid, 401 unauthenticated, 403 forbidden or other site, 404 not_found, 409 conflict not a co-CM.

POST
POST: Set a temporary password, returned once, and end the account's sessions.
  Who: owners.
  In: path id; { version }
  Out: 200 { person, temporary }
  Errors: 400 invalid, 401 unauthenticated, 403 forbidden not an owner or other site, 404 not_found, 409 conflict stale version.

POST
POST: Import a Trench Companion text export as a new warband; names that do not match are reported, not dropped.
  Who: anyone signed in.
  In: { text, name?, rulesSet?, rulesExpansions? }
  Out: 201 { warband: Warband, unmatched: string[], ambiguous: string[] }
  Errors: 400 invalid not a warband or no such faction, 401 unauthenticated, 403 forbidden other site, 404 not_found rules not loaded, 409 conflict no rules loaded.
